# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, files authored on Windows land as CRLF and git warns on every
# add. It also had a real consequence here: .gitignore was written with CRLF,
# and git does not strip the trailing \r from a pattern — so every rule in it
# silently matched nothing, and .env was staged for commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db  binary

# Diagrams are XML but large and machine-generated; keep them out of diffs
*.drawio -diff
